# Records docs/demo.gif with VHS (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs):
#   vhs docs/demo.tape
# Needs Claude Code logged in and Doc Tray installed. Keep the result under
# 10 seconds and 5 MB (README gate G2); trim with gifsicle if needed.
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "claude" Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "Write a one-line MARKET-REPORT-2026-10-06.md and four short notes doc1.md to doc4.md" Enter
Sleep 12s
Ctrl+X Tab
Type "1"
Sleep 1s
Type "j"
Sleep 700ms
Type "j"
Sleep 700ms
Tab Tab
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
